\f11\b0\fs24 \cf4 \cb3 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 I can imagine teaching the standard energy\'96momentum relationship through your perspective as a geometric investigation.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf4 \cb3 Start with the seven-dimensional multiplication table.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf4 \cb3 Show how 
